carbon stringers: Strategically placed to fine-tune flex, response, and overall feel
supertubes: C.S.T. (Central SuperTube) - lightweight hollow carbon cylinder running down the middle, boosts pop while maintaining torsional flex
aramid x-ply: Diamond weave laminate reinforced by Kevlar, increases torsional stiffness without being too heavy
core: Light Core (50/50 blend of Poplar and Paulownia, strong and lively, perfectly balanced for all mountain riding)
sidewall: Flex Walls (Urethane sidewalls instead of standard ABS, bonds more effectively to the core for a more durable and damp construction)
